    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14647" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀρᾰβ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Arabia,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.8
			</span></i>, etc. (also, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόσμος γυναικός</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>): poet. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀρραβία</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				17.86
			</span></i>:—Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀράβιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
				<i>Arabian,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ Ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.198
				</span></i>
			, al.:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀραβικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, χάραγμα</span>”
