				Plu.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				69
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>:—later <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄραβες</span></b>  (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄραψ</span>):—pecul. fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀραβίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				34.56
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀράβισσα</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				St.Byz.
			</span></i></div>
